blurb: The South Portland School Board held its first FY25 budget workshop, discussing
  proposed staffing changes, the impact of expiring federal COVID funds, and presentations
  on Multi-Tiered Systems of Support (MTSS) across all school levels. The meeting
  also highlighted the work of the Multilingual Department and McKinney-Vento program,
  with public comments focusing on the potential elimination of an art teacher position.
